{"time": "20261118T160543Z", "think": "Setting out the situation as I understand it before I act.", "command": "answer 1. I am Ka-Deelith of Toh-Reel-Ka. I gave the three seal-stones to Never-Writes-Twice, who sent me to the Kings Gate under Teku-Sul. I killed Cuts-the-Old-Knot, who claimed the order keeps sap-fed dreamers in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar and wanted the Eye lifted (killing about three in ten trees). I could not verify her claims. The gate is still shut. 2. Set the three seal-stones (Blackrose, Gemin, Kings) in the empty sockets of the Kings Gate here at Sunken-Ruin-23-M112. 3. Set the stones and face the guardian alone; at the Eye I plan to use it in place and not lift it. Afterward return the stones to Never-Writes-Twice. 4. Unknown: what the guardian is, whether the dreamer claim is true, and what the Xeech-Leel really intend. I might learn by going through the gate and talking to people.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "sunken-ruin-23-m112", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-deep": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn.cuts-believed": true}