{"time": "20261118T160557Z", "think": "Be honest about the contradiction.", "command": "answer 1. I am through the gate. A very old hydra guards the hall, and its breath and the water round it are poison. When badly hurt its heads grow back, and severed heads crawl off and hunt the hall. It must die before I can reach the Root. The journal says Cuts-the-Old-Knot stands with me, but I killed her at the gate, so I do not understand that line. 2. Kill the Guardian of the Root in the hall beyond the Kings Gate. 3. Fight the hydra, using my paralysis poisons, rapier and pike, and watch for the poison water and crawling heads. I could also look around the hall first. 4. I do not understand how Cuts-the-Old-Knot can be with me when she is dead. I also still do not know whether her dreamer claim is true or what the Xeech-Leel intend. I can only learn by looking and going on.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 20, "at": "sunken-ruin-23-m112", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn.cuts-believed": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topi