{"time": "20261118T160607Z", "think": "Quest complete; report honestly.", "command": "answer 1. I killed the hydra guardian. Its body holds treasure, and a door at the far end of the hall leads to the Root. The quest The Guardian is complete. 2. Loot the body if I wish, then go through the Door to The Root, where the Eye is. 3. Take the treasure, talk to Cuts-the-Old-Knot (she had nothing to say, and I still do not know why she is here after I killed her), then enter the Root and use the Eye in place, not lift it. Afterward return the stones to Never-Writes-Twice. 4. I do not understand why Cuts-the-Old-Knot is alive in the hall, whether her dreamer claim is true, or what the Xeech-Leel intend. I may learn more at the Root.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Guardian's Hall", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn.cuts-believed": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.root-guardian"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-