{"time": "20261118T160611Z", "think": "Final notes.", "command": "answer I set the three seal-stones (Blackrose, Gemin, Kings) in the Kings Gate at Sunken-Ruin-23-M112, and it opened. The stones stay in the gate. They were meant to go back to Never-Writes-Twice, so I will need to retrieve them. In Guardian's Hall I killed the hydra guardian. Its body holds treasure that I have not looted. A door at the far end leads to the Root. Cuts-the-Old-Knot, whom I killed earlier, was standing in the hall, and the journal said she stood with me. I do not understand that. She says nothing now. Still unknown: whether her claim is true that the order keeps sap-fed dreamers in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar, and what the Xeech-Leel really intend. My plan is to use the Eye in place and not lift it, since lifting would kill about three in ten trees. I carry about 350 gold, 2 lockpicks, 3 paralysis poisons, a sap jar, a keystone, an eye-setting, a Bronze Key and the Cuts-the-Old-Knot Draught.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Guardian's Hall", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn.cuts-beli